# Document every env var here with a placeholder. Never put real values in this file.
# Real values live in your shell, a gitignored .env, or a secret manager.

# GitHub MCP server (.mcp.json). Must be exported in the shell that starts Claude Code.
# Dedicated variable so a broad GITHUB_TOKEN in your shell is never picked up by accident.
# Use a fine-grained PAT, read-only, scoped to the repos you need, with an expiry.
GITHUB_MCP_TOKEN=
